                  "attributes": {
                    "width": "",
                    "height": ""
                  },
                  "assetPath": "assets/81f1ac4c7e7686106c33c7f2339a450c72f86f41c500fedcca78c66cf319b11d.webp"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "figcaption",
                  "attributes": {},
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "text",
                      "text": "پوسیدگی عمیق مزیال پیش از رابردم برداشته شده و بعد دندان ایزوله شده است. "
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "span",
                      "attributes": {
                        "dir": "ltr"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tag": "text",
                          "text": "(Cardinali & Gorni. The Use of the Rubber Dam in Endodontics (StyleItaliano) — Fig. 13–15 (Ch.11))"
